    title: "In Heaven, on Earth, and Under the Earth: Christ's Victorious Descent",
    desc: "Examines the biblical and theological foundation of Christ's descent to the dead on Holy Saturday, arguing from Ephesians 4, 1 Peter 3, and the Old Testament that the descent represents not suffering or postmortem evangelism, but the triumphant beginning of Christ's exaltation over demonic powers and death.",
